description:
Design a pipeline register module for the Instruction Decode to Execute stage of a processor. This module captures and holds control signals and operand values from the ID stage on the rising edge of the clock. It outputs these values for use in the Execute stage, effectively enabling data and control flow between pipeline stages while maintaining synchronization in a digital circuit design. Specific outputs include various control signals for writing registers, memory access, ALU operation codes, immediate values, and operands.
module top_module(wreg, m2reg, wmem, aluc, aluimm, mux, qa, qb, extend, clk,
              ewreg, em2reg, ewmem, ealuc, ealuimm, emux, eqa, eqb, eextend);

