description:
Design a 4-to-2 priority encoder. The module takes a 4-bit input, I, and outputs a 2-bit value, Y, representing the highest-order active input line. If multiple input lines are high, it prioritizes the highest order bit. If no input is active, the output defaults to 00.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] I,
    output reg [1:0] Y
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [3:0] I,
    output reg [1:0] Y
);always @* begin
    case (I)
        4'b0001: Y = 2'b00;
        4'b0010: Y = 2'b01;
        4'b0100: Y = 2'b10;
        4'b1000: Y = 2'b11;
        default: Y = 2'b00;
    endcase
end

endmodule

